Remotion (render/remotion, installed from npm)
    Renders every scene. Remotion License, https://www.remotion.dev/license
    Free for individuals, for-profit organisations with up to 3 employees,
    non-profits, and for evaluation -- including commercial use of the
    videos. A for-profit organisation larger than that needs a paid Remotion
    Company License (https://www.remotion.pro/license) before using narratr,
    because narratr runs Remotion. Obtaining it is your responsibility.

