    Royalty-free under the Pixabay Content License,
    https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/ -- commercial use allowed,
    no attribution required. It may not be sold or redistributed on a
    standalone basis (as the bare audio file, apart from a video or the
    Software).

Sample voice (assets/voices/sample-01.wav)
    Default voice audio generated with Chatterbox by Resemble AI, MIT
    License, https://github.com/resemble-ai/chatterbox. Audio produced by
    Chatterbox carries Resemble AI's imperceptible Perth watermark.

Other dependencies
    Chatterbox, PyTorch, torchaudio, FFmpeg, Mermaid, Shiki, Lucide, React
    and the rest of the dependencies in pyproject.toml and
